# Internal repo files. pages_build_output_dir = "." means the whole repo is
# uploaded as the static site, so docs/, scripts/, config and CI files were
# publicly reachable. _redirects is evaluated before static assets, so these
# rules make them unreachable. /data and /assets stay public (the app fetches
# them); /functions, /migrations and /node_modules are already excluded from
# upload by Pages — listed anyway as defense in depth.
